<!-- SWITCHED TO FIXED RELATIVE OFFSET (see La Spezia's comment block earlier in this file for
     the full explanation). Computed from GPS:Cargo Spawn -
     Civitavecchia:3336.74:-21066.03:21239, projected into Civitavecchia's local frame using
