     up). Note: Civitavecchia's own anchor position differs from the "Rome" territory anchor
     used in Territory-Zones.sbc/Territory-Points-LaSpezia.sbc - those are deliberately
     different points (Rome represents the city broadly; this is the actual port structure) -
     computed independently here from Civitavecchia's own SpawnConditions entry, not Rome's. -->

<!-- La Spezia Cargo Spawn (-> Civitavecchia) -->
		<EntityComponent xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_InventoryComponentDefinition">
            <Id>
                <TypeId>Inventory</TypeId>
